    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8719" root="حكم" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُكُومَةٌ</span></b>  an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَكَمَ</span> [q. v.]: (K:) [and
used as a simple subst.; pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُكُومَاتٌ</span>:] see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حُكْمٌ</span>,
in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also [<i>Judicial authority; authority to judge, give judgment, pass sentence,</i> or
<i>decide judicially,</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى أَمْرٍ</span> <i>respecting an affair,</i>
or <i>a case;</i>] a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِحْتَكَمَ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَحَكَّمَ</span>; and
so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُحْكُومَةٌ</span></b> . (K, TA.)

